WEBVTT

00:00:10.367 --> 00:00:11.407
(SCREAMS)

00:00:11.527 --> 00:00:12.567
What?

00:00:13.247 --> 00:00:14.647
Mayday! Mayday!
Mayday!

00:00:14.807 --> 00:00:15.807
Hold! Let him talk.

00:00:15.967 --> 00:00:17.927
Superheroes have forcibly
taken the bridge. Repeat.

00:00:18.127 --> 00:00:19.087
Now.

00:00:19.167 --> 00:00:20.727
-(SCREAMS)
-(GROANS)

00:00:30.407 --> 00:00:31.887
A little further.

00:00:32.047 --> 00:00:33.847
Little further. Stop.

00:00:37.527 --> 00:00:38.527
(JACK-JACK COOING)

00:00:39.727 --> 00:00:41.687
What the... A baby?

00:00:42.207 --> 00:00:44.087
Mom and Dad.
Uncle Lucius?

00:00:46.767 --> 00:00:48.247
-My mama.
-Jack-Jack, no!

00:00:48.327 --> 00:00:49.767
(BABBLING)

00:00:51.447 --> 00:00:53.127
A super baby?

00:00:56.447 --> 00:00:57.647
(GROWLS)

00:00:58.127 --> 00:00:59.447
No, no, no!

00:00:59.607 --> 00:01:00.607
Put him down!

00:01:01.207 --> 00:01:02.407
(GASPS)

00:01:02.527 --> 00:01:03.847
-Grab her!
-No!

00:01:04.047 --> 00:01:05.007
Hold Jack-Jack.

00:01:06.247 --> 00:01:08.087
(ALL GRUNTING)

00:01:13.327 --> 00:01:14.327
No!

00:01:15.487 --> 00:01:17.127
-(GASPS)
-ELASTIGIRL: Hey, it's me!

00:01:17.287 --> 00:01:18.847
Yeah, that's what I thought
last time.

00:01:18.927 --> 00:01:21.487
-(JACK-JACK CALLING OUT)
-Kids, what are you...

00:01:23.127 --> 00:01:25.207
You came for us?

00:01:25.807 --> 00:01:26.807
Don't be mad.

00:01:26.967 --> 00:01:29.567
Oh, sweetie,
how could I be mad?

00:01:30.447 --> 00:01:31.887
I'm proud.

00:01:32.887 --> 00:01:34.607
Not to break up
a tender moment,

00:01:34.687 --> 00:01:35.967
but where are we?

00:01:36.127 --> 00:01:37.447
Is this DEVTECH's ship?

00:01:37.847 --> 00:01:39.487
Evelyn Deavor
controls the Screenslaver...

00:01:39.647 --> 00:01:41.847
and until a second ago, us.

00:01:42.487 --> 00:01:44.527
-(RUMBLES)
-Where's the crew?

00:01:44.687 --> 00:01:46.567
AUTOMATED VOICE: Collision
detected. Correct course.

00:01:46.727 --> 00:01:47.887
Uh-oh.
Did I do that?

00:01:48.087 --> 00:01:51.127
Mom, the suit?
Try this.

00:01:53.687 --> 00:01:55.927
Phase Three.
Go on Phase Three!

00:01:59.407 --> 00:02:01.567
Why are the kids here?
You didn't go to the house?

00:02:01.767 --> 00:02:02.847
I went to the house.

00:02:03.007 --> 00:02:04.447
You didn't escape?
How did you not escape?

00:02:04.647 --> 00:02:06.527
BOTH: Hey! We just saved you!

00:02:06.727 --> 00:02:08.727
Escape? Escape from who?

00:02:08.807 --> 00:02:10.647
-(GROWLS)
-(GRUNTS)

00:02:11.687 --> 00:02:12.727
Those guys!

00:02:13.287 --> 00:02:15.327
(YELLING)

00:02:15.487 --> 00:02:17.927
What the...?
Jack-Jack has powers?

00:02:18.087 --> 00:02:19.887
We know.
Fight now, talk later.

00:02:20.327 --> 00:02:22.127
(ALL GRUNTING)

00:02:31.087 --> 00:02:32.927
-(GROWLING)
-(GROANING)

00:02:36.727 --> 00:02:38.407
-(VIOLET GASPS)
-(SCREECHES)

00:02:51.367 --> 00:02:53.407
-(SCREECHES)
-(YELPS)

00:02:53.567 --> 00:02:54.967
-(GROWLING)
-Jack-Jack.

00:02:55.127 --> 00:02:56.287
Laser eyes!

00:02:56.647 --> 00:02:57.767
(VIOLET IMITATES LASER FIRING)

00:03:02.127 --> 00:03:03.247
-(SCREECHES)
-(YELPS)

00:03:06.287 --> 00:03:07.287
Ah-ha!

00:03:07.367 --> 00:03:08.447
(GRUNTS)

00:03:08.527 --> 00:03:10.207
(BOTH GRUNTING)

00:03:18.167 --> 00:03:19.207
Ugh.

00:03:24.327 --> 00:03:25.807
Come with me, Winston.

00:03:26.407 --> 00:03:28.167
-Did I faint?
-You'll be safe here.

00:03:28.327 --> 00:03:30.127
Safe? Safe from what?

00:03:31.487 --> 00:03:33.527
Where are the diplomats?
The supers?

00:03:33.687 --> 00:03:34.807
Still hypnotized.

00:03:34.887 --> 00:03:37.127
(SIGHS) What have you done?

00:03:41.607 --> 00:03:43.127
Evelyn, she's escaping.

00:03:43.647 --> 00:03:45.767
Well, go after her.
Finish your mission.

00:03:45.927 --> 00:03:48.047
I can't just go!
What about the kids?

00:03:48.167 --> 00:03:50.327
-Jack-Jack, who's gonna...
-VIOLET: Mom!

00:03:50.847 --> 00:03:52.647
Go. We've got this.

00:03:54.527 --> 00:03:56.247
Voyd, come with me.

00:03:56.407 --> 00:03:57.407
I'll go shut down the engine.

00:03:57.567 --> 00:03:59.207
I'll try to slow the ship
from the bow.

00:03:59.367 --> 00:04:02.207
Wait, someone's missing.
Where's the crusher guy?

00:04:02.407 --> 00:04:03.967
Strap in now!

00:04:06.047 --> 00:04:07.127
(GRUNTING)

00:04:10.247 --> 00:04:11.367
(LAUGHING)

00:04:19.727 --> 00:04:20.967
It's for your own good.

00:04:21.447 --> 00:04:22.767
No!

00:04:23.167 --> 00:04:24.207
This is.

00:04:24.487 --> 00:04:25.567
(GRUNTS)

00:04:29.367 --> 00:04:31.087
-(GRUNTS)
-(GROANING)

00:04:35.807 --> 00:04:38.047
-We're too late.
-Get me up to the jet.

00:04:40.487 --> 00:04:41.607
(YELPS)

00:04:44.647 --> 00:04:46.087
(GRUNTING)

00:04:53.167 --> 00:04:54.167
(GROANS)

00:04:59.047 --> 00:05:00.087
(EXHALES IN RELIEF)

00:05:00.847 --> 00:05:01.967
(GRUNTS)

00:05:02.087 --> 00:05:04.927
Hey, you did this.
Can you undo it?

00:05:05.087 --> 00:05:07.167
You want me to un-crush?

00:05:07.327 --> 00:05:09.087
What? No one's ever
asked for that?

00:05:09.287 --> 00:05:11.887
No. To un-crush is silly.
Why un-crush?

00:05:12.047 --> 00:05:13.607
To get into the engine room.

00:05:13.687 --> 00:05:14.767
Oh, forget it.
We don't have enough time.

00:05:14.927 --> 00:05:17.287
What if I said
to un-punch someone?

00:05:17.367 --> 00:05:18.367
What do you do?

00:05:22.207 --> 00:05:23.887
Welcome aboard, Elastigirl.

00:05:24.047 --> 00:05:25.487
Although
we haven't yet reached

00:05:25.567 --> 00:05:26.887
our cruising altitude...

00:05:28.367 --> 00:05:30.887
feel free to roam about
the cabin.

00:05:30.967 --> 00:05:33.247
-(GROANING)
-Or just relax...

00:05:33.407 --> 00:05:36.127
and let the cabin roam
about you.

00:05:45.327 --> 00:05:47.127
I can't get
to the engine room!

00:05:47.327 --> 00:05:48.767
We gotta do something!

00:05:48.847 --> 00:05:50.247
Because trying to slow it down
ain't working.

00:05:50.407 --> 00:05:52.127
Hey! What about
turning the boat?

00:05:52.287 --> 00:05:53.407
BOTH: The steering's
been destroyed!

00:05:53.567 --> 00:05:56.167
-Dash means from the outside!
-Yeah!

00:05:56.327 --> 00:05:57.367
If we break off
one of the foils

00:05:57.447 --> 00:05:58.447
and turn the rudder...

00:05:58.607 --> 00:06:00.607
we can veer the ship
away from the city!

00:06:01.047 --> 00:06:02.087
That might work.

00:06:02.167 --> 00:06:03.287
I'll turn the front,
you turn the rear.

00:06:03.447 --> 00:06:05.727
Using the rudder?
That's underwater.

00:06:05.807 --> 00:06:06.847
How am I supposed to get...

00:06:07.007 --> 00:06:08.927
All right.
Come on, kids.

00:06:09.087 --> 00:06:12.007
Dad, I know
this is going to work.

00:06:12.167 --> 00:06:14.487
But if it doesn't,
and we crash...

00:06:14.687 --> 00:06:17.887
my shields are probably better
protection than the ship.

00:06:18.047 --> 00:06:21.287
I should stay here.
With Jack-Jack.

00:06:22.127 --> 00:06:23.287
That's my girl.

00:06:23.607 --> 00:06:26.007
Remember, Bob,
we're both turning right!

00:06:32.727 --> 00:06:34.487
EVELYN: You know what's sad?

00:06:38.167 --> 00:06:39.847
If it weren't
for your core beliefs...

00:06:40.047 --> 00:06:42.367
I think we could have been
good friends.

00:06:43.607 --> 00:06:45.287
At least... (GASPING)

00:06:46.447 --> 00:06:48.247
I have core beliefs.

00:06:49.967 --> 00:06:51.167
We have breaking news...

00:06:51.327 --> 00:06:53.487
While there is
still no radio contact,

00:06:53.567 --> 00:06:54.967
the ship
has changed direction...

00:06:55.127 --> 00:06:57.687
and is heading towards land
at a high rate of speed.

00:07:02.047 --> 00:07:03.287
So, Dash...

00:07:04.767 --> 00:07:06.367
I am going to the rudder.

00:07:06.527 --> 00:07:09.247
Once I turn the ship,
you hit the pull up button.

00:07:09.447 --> 00:07:11.287
-Okay, Dad.
-Now lower me down...

00:07:11.367 --> 00:07:12.447
(SCREAMS)

00:07:15.567 --> 00:07:18.887
The reputations of superheroes
are ruined.

00:07:19.087 --> 00:07:22.167
You will never
become legal. Ever.

00:07:22.687 --> 00:07:24.007
Never?

00:07:24.087 --> 00:07:25.287
(LAUGHS) No.

00:07:25.647 --> 00:07:27.367
-Ever?
-No.

00:07:27.727 --> 00:07:30.847
Not even a little
smidgee-widgee?

00:07:31.007 --> 00:07:32.207
Oh, hypoxia.

00:07:32.367 --> 00:07:34.287
When you don't have
enough oxygen,

00:07:34.367 --> 00:07:36.167
-things seem really silly.
-(GASPING)

